  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/contributors/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib.svg?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"152\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib/network/members\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/forks/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib.svg?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib/stargazers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib.svg?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"96\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib.svg?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"142\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib/blob/master/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib.svg?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinkedin.com%252fin%252fkit-lehto\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-LinkedIn-black.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=linkedin&colorB=555\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pbwnMwnUD6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1032138561618726952?logo=discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge&label=Discord\" alt=\"\" width=\"186\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu-badges-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/v/modmenu-badges-lib?label=Modrinth&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"182\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ModMenu Badges Lib</strong></h2>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">更多徽章！！！</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">關於專案<br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/33298273/233725872-902aa00e-618d-48d3-b594-990d2cad85ae.png&n=-1\" alt=\"image\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這只是一個用於向 ModMenu 添加自訂徽章的簡單函式庫。</p>\n<p>例如，<a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tschipcraft</a> 在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/dynamiclights\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Lights</a> 中使用它來顯示資料包徽章。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">設定</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">操作指南可於 <a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/modmenu-badges-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上找到</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/yet-another-cobble-gen/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">開放的問題</a> 以獲取完整的功能提案清單（以及已知問題）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">參與貢獻</h3>\n<p>正是您的貢獻讓開源社群成為一個學習、啟發與創造的絕佳之地。我們非常感謝您做出的任何貢獻。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果您有改進建議，請 Fork 該儲存庫並建立 Pull Request。您也可以直接開啟一個標記為「enhancement」的 Issue。別忘了給專案點星支持！再次感謝！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Fork 專案</li>\n<li>建立您的功能分支 (<code>git checkout -b feature/AmazingFeature</code>)</li>\n<li>提交您的變更 (<code>git commit -m 'Add some AmazingFeature'</code>)</li>\n<li>推送到分支 (<code>git push origin feature/AmazingFeature</code>)</li>\n<li>開啟 Pull Request</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">授權條款</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本專案依據 MIT 授權條款發行。有關詳細資訊，請見 <strong><code>LICENSE.txt</code></strong>。</p>",
